# "thứ" prefixes a numeral to make it an ordinal ("thứ tám" eighth).  The same
# word names a weekday when the numeral is one word long ("thứ hai" Monday),
# which is why it is optional wherever an ordinal is already unambiguous:
# "thế kỷ 20" and "thế kỷ thứ 20" are the same twentieth century.
# en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/th%E1%BB%A9.
thứ
